👑🧠 Birbal and the Missing Necklace (Raw Story)

One day, the queen lost her precious necklace.

Everyone in the palace was worried.

Emperor Akbar asked Birbal to find the thief.

Birbal gathered all the servants and said, “The necklace is hidden in one of your rooms. Whoever took it should return it quietly.”

No one spoke.

Birbal then said, “I will leave a special powder at the door. The thief’s hands will turn black by morning.”

The servants became nervous.

The real thief secretly returned the necklace at night.

The next morning, the necklace was found.

Birbal smiled and said, “The guilty person returned it out of fear.”

Akbar praised Birbal.

💖 Moral:

Fear of being caught often reveals the truth.
